# Keep secrets and runtime state OUT of the build context. The Dockerfile is
# COPY . . — anything missing here lands in the build-stage layer: .env holds
# RELAY_NSEC, and .audit/ is the compose state mount, whose every cursor flush
# would invalidate the COPY layer and force a cold Gradle rebuild.
.git
**/build
.gradle
.kotlin
*.log
.env
.env.*
.audit
router.conf
